<p>Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy said he spoke by phone with President Donald Trump as Ukraine prepared for a fresh diplomatic push to end Russia’s war. Ukrainian officials are set to meet U.S. envoys in Geneva as talks pick up again. Zelenskyy said the next round of three-sided talks involving Ukraine, Russia, and the United States is expected in early March, with the aim of clearing the way for a leaders-level meeting.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/tuCGQkIW1_-weSc7_Wwqrg_uaxdubunbZqyu4Oo4Ylv6ambglX7o33xS1xQuLoP26AwAtLpsscS11y6f3XpwqoiVBFwkDqnGVy-Mo_wYEI-okDbtxY-510krcRKZnpGkuTpK3Wt1wYAaWV18FuPkW6_-0qKauJX5vUOU8YfWuQmheR8lk0sK9C_T4fUEK0j-Y1Azx1R0YlZpPvJEVtLnAu3AfKjmWjHOZ0h5tMnhLCDJYGmQHjQZM6kSOp-pgaQZfD-_j2KaWiZ3dDLyew' alt='Ukraine&#x27;s President Volodymyr Zelenskiy speaks at a press conference in Kyiv on Feb. 25, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Timing: The call came ahead of a Geneva meeting expected on Thursday between Ukrainian and U.S. envoys, according to multiple reports.</li><li>Who was on the call: SCMP said U.S. negotiator Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner also joined the Trump-Zelenskyy phone call.</li><li>Political context: RFE/RL said the diplomatic push comes as pressure grows in parts of the policy debate for a tougher line on Russia.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Volodymyr Zelenskyy: He said the negotiating teams are working intensively and publicly thanked them for their role in efforts to end the war. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/trump-zelenskyy-speak-before-ukraine-us-talks-in-geneva/article70677184.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li><li>White House: It confirmed the phone call with Zelenskyy as diplomacy picked up ahead of renewed negotiations in Geneva. (<a href='https://www.rferl.org/a/trump-zelenskyy-call-geneva-talks-russia-ukraine-pressure/33688205.html'>Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty</a>)</li><li>PBS NewsHour: It described a plan in which Ukrainian representatives meet Trump’s envoys first, ahead of another round of trilateral talks that would include Russia. (<a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/ukrainian-officials-will-meet-trump-envoys-in-geneva-for-talks'>PBS NewsHour</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/zelensky-after-speaking-with-trump-says-talks-should-lead-to-leaders-meeting'>Ukraine’s Zelensky, after speaking with Trump, says talks should lead to leaders’ meeting</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-ukraine-russia-leaders-meeting-zelensky-trump/'>Ukraine peace talks should lead to leaders’ meeting in March, Zelensky says</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rferl.org/a/trump-zelenskyy-call-geneva-talks-russia-ukraine-pressure/33688205.html'>Trump, Zelenskyy Speak By Phone Ahead Of Geneva Talks As Pressure Mounts For Tougher Line On Russia</a> - rferl.org</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/ukrainian-officials-will-meet-trump-envoys-in-geneva-for-talks'>Ukrainian officials will meet Trump envoys in Geneva for talks</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/trump-zelenskyy-speak-before-ukraine-us-talks-in-geneva/article70677184.ece'>Trump, Zelenskyy speak before Ukraine-U.S. talks in Geneva</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/russia-central-asia/article/3344656/zelensky-speaks-trump-says-talks-should-lead-leaders-meeting-russia'>Zelensky speaks with Trump, says talks should lead to leaders’ meeting with Russia</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.firstpost.com/world/trump-holds-phone-call-with-ukraines-zelenskyy-ahead-of-geneva-talks-13983764.html'>Trump holds phone call with Ukraine’s Zelenskyy ahead of Geneva talks</a> - firstpost.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/2/25/zelenskyy-speaks-with-trump-about-peace-efforts-eyes-leaders-level-talks'>Zelenskyy speaks with Trump about peace efforts, eyes leaders-l